sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Alice
    participant B as Bob
    participant C as Carol
    A->>+B: start
    alt ok
        B->>C: ask
        Note right of C: a fairly long note on the right
    else fail
        B->>A: err
    end
    B-->>-A: done
    loop outer
      opt inner
        Note left of A: left side note here
        A->>A: think hard about it
      end
    end
